| **High** | Missing `<FuelType>` defaults to `"electricity"` rather than error | `xml_helpers.rs:10` |
| **High** | Unit conversion functions don't recognise SI unit strings (e.g. `"m2"`, `"gal"`, `"m"`) — unrecognised units return raw value | `building.rs:1984-2171` |
| **Medium** | Duplicate fuel-parsing logic with divergent behaviour | `xml_helpers.rs` vs `resolve_water_heater.rs` |
| **Medium** | Duplicate temperature-parsing logic (`child_temperature_c` vs `convert_temperature_to_c`) | `xml_helpers.rs:43` vs `building.rs:2150` |
| **Medium** | `"none"` fuel maps to `FuelType::Electric` instead of `FuelType::None` | `xml_helpers.rs:12` |
| **Medium** | Energy-unit load parsers return `None` on wrong units rather than warning/error | `xml_helpers.rs:68-97` |
